#4471 merged every date report into one ticket and marked it known. Subject lines
matched. The cause does not. It depends on the tenant and the channel.

<Callout kind="warn">
  Known was wrong. The ticket holds two causes. The smaller one has no ticket of its own.
</Callout>

## Causes

<CauseTable ticket={4471} />

`parser` is the shared parser. It reads every date month first. A day-first tenant's
dates come out flipped. Filed as
[parser](https://github.com/TomaszKotowski/s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/1).

`hint` is booking-v3's date hint. The form prints MM/DD/YYYY. On the form channel,
people type what the hint says, and the form reads it the tenant's way. Filed as
[hint](https://github.com/TomaszKotowski/s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/2).

Intake tagged reports from the browser. That tag is a guess. The table counts the
tags beside the cause.

